# Line-ending policy: LF everywhere, on every platform (repo is developed
# across WSL/Windows — without this, editors silently reintroduce CRLF and
# `git diff --check` flags phantom "trailing whitespace" on added lines).
# Tree fully normalized to LF on 2026-07-23 (21 stragglers converted).
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets — never touch line endings.
*.png binary
*.webp binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.gguf binary
